  "title": "Scripps Sports secures multi-year partnership with Premier Women’s Rodeo",
  "summary": "CINCINNATI – Scripps Sports has entered into a comprehensive multi-year broadcast partnership with Professional Bull Riders (PBR), the global leader in bull riding entertainment, to bring Premier Women’s Rodeo (PWR) exclusively to Scripps’ national television networks ION and Grit beginning in May.",
